[{"text": "I now invite his excellency so the", "start": 3.52, "duration": 7.999}, {"text": "minister foreign affairs of Indonesia", "start": 7.68, "duration": 7.72}, {"text": "to address the assembly", "start": 11.519, "duration": 3.881}, {"text": "Your Excellency", "start": 33.92, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Hal Rahman,", "start": 36.239, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "President of the 81st session of the", "start": 38.32, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "United Nations General Assembly.", "start": 40.16, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "Your Excellency Antonio Gutirez,", "start": 43.52, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "Secretary General of the United Nations,", "start": 46.96, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 50.32, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Heads of State, and Heads of Government,", "start": 52.16, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "Ministers, distinguished delegates,", "start": 56.0, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen.", "start": 59.359, "duration": 5.801}, {"text": "Assalamu alaykumati.", "start": 61.68, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": "Shalom salomastay.", "start": 66.479, "duration": 4.281}, {"text": "May peace be upon all of us.", "start": 75.119, "duration": 5.721}, {"text": "81 years ago", "start": 86.24, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "from the ashes of the second world war", "start": 89.2, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "Indonesia and the United Nations were", "start": 92.88, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "born.", "start": 95.439, "duration": 2.401}, {"text": "We emerge from a world devastated by war", "start": 98.32, "duration": 8.56}, {"text": "with a shared conviction that never", "start": 103.92, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "again should humanity", "start": 106.88, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "leave its future to war and division.", "start": 109.92, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "And we shared a founding promise to", "start": 114.56, "duration": 8.28}, {"text": "build a future of peace.", "start": 117.92, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "For eight decades, we have worked to", "start": 123.119, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "turn that promise into progress.", "start": 125.68, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Nations freed themselves from", "start": 129.36, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "colonialism.", "start": 131.28, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "Globalization connected our economy.", "start": 133.28, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "Technology transformed our societies", "start": 136.319, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "and development improves the lives of", "start": 140.48, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "billions.", "start": 143.68, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "But progress has never been linear. We", "start": 146.08, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "have lived through financial crisis, a", "start": 149.52, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "global pandemic, climate disasters,", "start": 152.08, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "geopolitical rivalries and conflicts", "start": 155.36, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "around the world.", "start": 158.319, "duration": 3.481}, {"text": "With every transformation and every", "start": 161.92, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "crisis, one lesson remains clear. For", "start": 164.16, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "peace and prosperity to endure,", "start": 168.4, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "multilateralism", "start": 171.519, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "must be resilient. It must be able to", "start": 173.04, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "adapt, to respond, and most importantly", "start": 175.76, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "to deliver.", "start": 180.08, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "Because multilateralism", "start": 182.159, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "that cannot deliver, we lose people's", "start": 184.239, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "trust. And without trust,", "start": 187.2, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "multilateralism will never endure.", "start": 190.239, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Building resilient multilateralism", "start": 195.12, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "begins at hope. Begins with resilient", "start": 197.599, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "nations. It starts at home. And", "start": 200.0, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "Indonesia has long understood this for", "start": 203.68, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "decades.", "start": 207.519, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "In the 1960s, Indonesia developed the", "start": 209.36, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "concept of national resilience to", "start": 212.48, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "safeguard our identity, to protect our", "start": 214.879, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "sovereignty and unity, and to sustain", "start": 217.599, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "our development in the face of", "start": 220.799, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "challenges and obstacles. At the heart", "start": 222.72, "duration": 8.239}, {"text": "of our resilience are our people.", "start": 226.56, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "A nation that is resilient when families", "start": 230.959, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "A nation is resilient when families can", "start": 234.08, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "provide for their households. When", "start": 237.04, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "farmers can produce. When workers can", "start": 239.68, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "find decent jobs. And when children can", "start": 242.799, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "learn, grow, and dream about their", "start": 245.84, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "future.", "start": 249.12, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "For Indonesia,", "start": 250.72, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "this means building greater", "start": 252.72, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "self-sufficiency in food and", "start": 254.08, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "strengthening our energy security.", "start": 256.72, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Most importantly, this also means", "start": 260.799, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "investing in the future of our people,", "start": 263.28, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "ensuring our children receive quality", "start": 266.88, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "education and ensuring our people have", "start": 269.44, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "access to essential healthcare.", "start": 272.56, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "At the same time, we are building an", "start": 276.0, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "economy that can withstand shocks and", "start": 278.88, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "create opportunities,", "start": 281.759, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "more jobs, stronger industries, and", "start": 283.84, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "greater productive capacity.", "start": 287.04, "duration": 7.439}, {"text": "Central to our resilience is our ability", "start": 290.8, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "to manage differences and preserve our", "start": 294.479, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "unity.", "start": 297.6, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "As a nation of more than 280 million", "start": 300.16, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "people, Indonesia has learned that", "start": 302.72, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "diversity is not something to overcome.", "start": 305.68, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "It is something to manage, respect and", "start": 308.96, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "turn into strength. Through democratic", "start": 312.32, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "participation,", "start": 315.36, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "dialogue and respect for differences. We", "start": 316.96, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "we preserve our unity.", "start": 320.72, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "From Ache to Papua, from Miangas to Rot,", "start": 323.919, "duration": 8.401}, {"text": "Indonesia is one people. Indonesia is", "start": 328.96, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "one nation.", "start": 332.32, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "We also continue to strengthen the", "start": 335.199, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "promotion and protection of human rights", "start": 337.039, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "through our national mechanisms and our", "start": 340.24, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "commitment to international human rights", "start": 342.88, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "obligations.", "start": 345.44, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "This goes hand inhand with building our", "start": 347.36, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "national resilience because human rights", "start": 349.759, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "are not only the absence of violence.", "start": 353.12, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "They are also about ensuring that people", "start": 355.84, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "have food, education and healthcare.", "start": 358.32, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "To our neighbors,", "start": 363.039, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "friends, and partners, let there be no", "start": 364.96, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "doubt Indonesia stands strong today,", "start": 368.4, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "grounded firmly in democracy, human", "start": 371.84, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "rights, and the rule of law.", "start": 374.479, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "And when nations are resilient at home,", "start": 378.16, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "they have greater capacity to contribute", "start": 380.639, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "beyond their borders.", "start": 383.84, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "A food secure Indonesia can contribute", "start": 386.639, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "more to regional and global food", "start": 389.44, "duration": 3.599}, {"text": "security.", "start": 391.36, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "The more energy resilient Indonesia can", "start": 393.039, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "contribute more to the global energy", "start": 395.759, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "transition,", "start": 398.56, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "a stronger economy opens greater", "start": 400.08, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "opportunities for cooperation and shared", "start": 402.88, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "prosperity. This is how national", "start": 405.919, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "resilience becomes collective resilience", "start": 409.36, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "and this is how resilience helps us", "start": 412.72, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "advance the SDGs.", "start": 415.68, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 418.96, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "a resilient nation contributes to a", "start": 421.039, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "resil resilient region. Our national", "start": 423.84, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "resilience will support and complement a", "start": 426.96, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "region that is stable, peaceful, and", "start": 429.36, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "predictable.", "start": 432.4, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "Southeast Asia is home to one of the", "start": 434.4, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "world's largest productive age", "start": 437.599, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "populations. It is now the world's fifth", "start": 439.68, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "largest economy, supported by a large", "start": 442.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "and fast growing digital economy.", "start": 445.919, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "At the center of this dynamic region is", "start": 449.12, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Azan.", "start": 451.919, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "Azan brings together nations with", "start": 453.84, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "different histories, political systems,", "start": 456.0, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "level of development and national", "start": 459.12, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "interest. We do not always agree, but we", "start": 461.28, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "have made a conscious choice to stay", "start": 465.52, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "together and we choose to keep talking", "start": 468.479, "duration": 7.681}, {"text": "even when agreement is difficult.", "start": 472.08, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "For almost six decades, Azan has managed", "start": 476.16, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "differences, maintained communication,", "start": 479.36, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "and continued seeking common ground.", "start": 482.319, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "This is the strength that comes from", "start": 485.84, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "Azan unity and centrality.", "start": 488.0, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "It enables us to engage all partners and", "start": 491.199, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "preserve space for dialogue and", "start": 494.4, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "cooperation", "start": 496.319, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "even as a strategic competition", "start": 497.84, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "intensifies around us.", "start": 500.24, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "At the same time,", "start": 504.4, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "building a resilient region requires the", "start": 506.96, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "ability to adapt. This is why Azan must", "start": 508.96, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "continue to evolve so that it remains", "start": 512.24, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "fit for purpose and beneficial for its", "start": 514.88, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "people and the wider region.", "start": 517.839, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 521.36, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "resilience at home and at the regional", "start": 523.2, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "level must be matched by a multilateral", "start": 525.6, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "system capable of supporting and", "start": 528.64, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "sustaining it.", "start": 531.36, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "This is where the United Nations remain", "start": 533.12, "duration": 3.839}, {"text": "indispensable.", "start": 535.12, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "The United Nations give nations the", "start": 536.959, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "space to resolve differences without", "start": 539.44, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "resorting to conflict. It provides", "start": 543.12, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "common rules when interests compete.", "start": 545.92, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "And it allows us to combine our", "start": 549.92, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "capacities when no country can act", "start": 552.16, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "effectively alone. This is why Indonesia", "start": 555.279, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "continues to believe in the United", "start": 558.88, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "Nations.", "start": 561.2, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "But believing in the United Nations also", "start": 563.04, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "means believing that it must evolve with", "start": 565.12, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "the world it serves. Let us be clear", "start": 567.839, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "that the answer to imperfect", "start": 571.68, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "multilateralism is not less", "start": 573.12, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "multilateralism. It is a stronger and", "start": 575.2, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "better multilateralism.", "start": 578.0, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "A multilateral system fit for the 21st", "start": 580.8, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "century must be more representative,", "start": 583.44, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "more agile, and better able to deliver.", "start": 586.16, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Institutional transformation will not", "start": 590.24, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "happen overnight, but the urgency of", "start": 592.08, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "today's challenges requires us to act", "start": 594.959, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "now.", "start": 598.56, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "We must start by strengthening our", "start": 601.12, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "collective capacity to withstand crisis,", "start": 602.88, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "responding effectively to global crisis", "start": 606.8, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "and humanitarian situations", "start": 609.6, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "and sustaining peace development and", "start": 612.959, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "cooperation.", "start": 616.16, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "At the same time, international", "start": 617.76, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "financial architecture must also evolve", "start": 620.48, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "to respond better to the needs of", "start": 623.279, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "developing countries and to give them", "start": 626.079, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "greater space to pursue their own", "start": 628.079, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "development priorities and build their", "start": 630.959, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "resilience.", "start": 633.92, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "But stronger institutions alone will not", "start": 636.24, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "save multilateralism.", "start": 639.839, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "institution are only as strong as the", "start": 642.8, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "principles we are willing to uphold.", "start": 645.519, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "International law must be upheld", "start": 649.12, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "consistently.", "start": 651.76, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Sovereignty must be respected and", "start": 653.279, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "colonialism must be brought to an end.", "start": 655.76, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "This is where Palestine remains one of", "start": 660.079, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "the clearest test of these principles", "start": 663.44, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "and the test of our conscience.", "start": 665.92, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "The clear violation of international law", "start": 669.839, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "in Gaza and the West Bank are", "start": 672.16, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "reminiscent of our world pre945,", "start": 674.72, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "a world pre the UN charter, pre the", "start": 678.079, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "universal declaration of human rights", "start": 681.2, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "and pre the four 1949 Geneva", "start": 683.92, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "Conventions.", "start": 687.6, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "A world where a certain race was almost", "start": 690.079, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "anhilated.", "start": 693.839, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "Indonesia knows what it means to", "start": 695.6, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "struggle against colonialism. to", "start": 697.279, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "struggle in a world where international", "start": 699.68, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "law was weak and might was right. Our", "start": 702.0, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "nation's journey to independence has", "start": 706.399, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "shaped our consistent support for the", "start": 709.44, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Palestinian people and their right to", "start": 711.36, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "determine their own future.", "start": 714.0, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Indonesia will continue to stand with", "start": 717.6, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "the Palestinian people until their right", "start": 719.36, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "to self-determination is fulfilled and", "start": 721.92, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "until an independent and sovereign state", "start": 724.56, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "of Palestine is realized based on the", "start": 727.279, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "two-state solution in accordance with", "start": 730.32, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "international law and internationally", "start": 733.04, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "agreed parameters.", "start": 735.6, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Palestine is not only a question for one", "start": 738.0, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "region. It is a test of whether", "start": 740.32, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "multilateral system can uphold the very", "start": 744.32, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "principles it was created to defend and", "start": 747.12, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "whether it can deliver when it matters", "start": 750.24, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "most.", "start": 752.959, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 754.8, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "an effective multilateral system also", "start": 757.44, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "requires effective leadership.", "start": 760.639, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "Indonesia's leadership philosophy passed", "start": 764.079, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "down through generations teaches us that", "start": 767.12, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "leaders must possess the capability to", "start": 770.639, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "lead by example from the front, build", "start": 773.839, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "confidence while standing among the", "start": 777.519, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "people and empower from behind.", "start": 779.36, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "Leadership is not simply about", "start": 784.48, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": "commanding.", "start": 786.079, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "It is about exercising wisdom and giving", "start": 787.68, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "others the strength to move forward.", "start": 790.88, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "Secretary General Antonio Gutirez has", "start": 795.04, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "led this organization through an", "start": 797.68, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "exceptionally challenging period,", "start": 800.16, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "wars and geopolitical tensions, a global", "start": 802.959, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "pandemic, humanitarian emergencies and", "start": 806.8, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "rapid technological transformation.", "start": 810.32, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "Indonesia expresses its appreciation for", "start": 814.079, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "his leadership and service over the past", "start": 817.44, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "decade.", "start": 820.8, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "Throughout these challenges, the UN", "start": 822.72, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "continues to provide an important", "start": 825.519, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "platform for dialogue and collective", "start": 827.44, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "problem solving.", "start": 830.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "The next secretary general will carry an", "start": 832.8, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "equally important responsibility", "start": 835.68, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "to uphold the charter, strengthen the", "start": 838.399, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "organization, and to translate", "start": 841.279, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "multilateralism into concrete results", "start": 843.92, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "for people.", "start": 846.8, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Effective leadership must also be", "start": 849.44, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "accompanied with the full commitment of", "start": 852.56, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "member states to make multilateralism", "start": 855.12, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "work.", "start": 858.16, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Indonesia is prepared to carry its share", "start": 859.839, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "as our constitution mandates us to", "start": 863.44, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "contribute to a world based on freedom,", "start": 866.0, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "lasting peace and social justice.", "start": 869.68, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "Through diplomacy and mediation,", "start": 873.279, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Indonesia has contributed to resolving", "start": 876.48, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "conflicts in the region and beyond. We", "start": 879.279, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "have been among the top tier", "start": 882.56, "duration": 3.839}, {"text": "contributors to UN peacekeeping", "start": 883.92, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "missions, deploying personnel to", "start": 886.399, "duration": 8.12}, {"text": "missions around the world since 1957.", "start": 889.44, "duration": 5.079}, {"text": "For nearly two decades, Indonesian", "start": 894.8, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "peacekeepers have served under under the", "start": 897.36, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "UN flag in Lebanon.", "start": 901.04, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "UNIFIL may be entering its final", "start": 904.48, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "chapter, but Indonesia's commitment", "start": 906.959, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "does not end with the mission.", "start": 910.639, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "The experience,", "start": 914.639, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "sacrifice, and dedication of our", "start": 916.56, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "peacekeepers will continue to shape", "start": 919.92, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "Indonesia's contribution to", "start": 923.12, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "international peace and security.", "start": 925.12, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "We will carry our diplomacy forward", "start": 928.88, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "through humanitarian assistance, through", "start": 931.68, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "peace building, and through engagement", "start": 934.399, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "across regions and institutions.", "start": 937.199, "duration": 8.161}, {"text": "Mr. President, it is in this spirit that", "start": 941.04, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "Indonesia present its candidature for a", "start": 945.36, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "non-permanent seat on the UN Security", "start": 948.48, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "Council for the 2029 2030 term.", "start": 951.44, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "Our commitment is clear. Fostering", "start": 956.88, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "unity,", "start": 959.92, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "advancing peace.", "start": 961.519, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "Fostering unity means", "start": 964.399, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "rebuilding trust in the multilateral", "start": 966.88, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "system and keeping channels of dialogue", "start": 969.199, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "open. Advancing peace requires us to", "start": 971.839, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "uphold international law and make", "start": 975.199, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "effective use of the tools available to", "start": 977.36, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "us. Indonesia will work to keep dialogue", "start": 979.6, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "open, build common ground, and turn", "start": 982.959, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "shared responsibility into practical", "start": 985.68, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "cooperation.", "start": 988.32, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "We will uphold the UN charter", "start": 989.92, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "consistently to maintain international", "start": 992.48, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "peace and security. We will bring the", "start": 995.199, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "same principle that guides our foreign", "start": 997.6, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "policy to engage with all and keep the", "start": 999.519, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "space for cooperation open. As President", "start": 1003.12, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Prabosanto mentioned in his very lecture", "start": 1006.24, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "last year, 1,000 friends are too few and", "start": 1008.8, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "an enemy is too many. The same approach", "start": 1012.399, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "guides Indonesia's engagement with all", "start": 1016.399, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "partners through Azan G20 D8 bricks MKTA", "start": 1018.959, "duration": 9.521}, {"text": "and the UN Indonesia will extend the", "start": 1025.039, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "friendship to deliver practical", "start": 1028.48, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "cooperation.", "start": 1030.72, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "Mr. President, 81 years ago,", "start": 1032.799, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Indonesia fought against colonialism so", "start": 1036.799, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "we could chart our own future. Today we", "start": 1039.679, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "reaffirm our promise for a future peace", "start": 1043.6, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "we all share.", "start": 1046.88, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Also one year ago President Prabos", "start": 1049.44, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Subanto called upon us to draw closer", "start": 1052.0, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "not drift apart. Today I carry that call", "start": 1055.2, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "forward. And as we draw closer closer", "start": 1059.36, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "let us also make each other stronger.", "start": 1063.44, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Strong enough for our nations to", "start": 1066.64, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "withstand crisis. strong enough for our", "start": 1068.08, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "regions to preserve cooperation. Strong", "start": 1070.24, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "enough for our institutions to deliver", "start": 1072.64, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "for people.", "start": 1076.08, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Because resilience is not simply about", "start": 1078.0, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "surviving the storms. It is about having", "start": 1080.48, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "the strength to keep moving forward", "start": 1082.96, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "together. And only through our", "start": 1085.76, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "collective collective resilience can the", "start": 1088.64, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "United Nations be strong enough to", "start": 1092.08, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "fulfill the promise we made 81 years", "start": 1094.88, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "ago. A future of peace for generations", "start": 1097.039, "duration": 8.441}, {"text": "to come. I thank you.", "start": 1100.96, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "I thank", "start": 1120.48, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "the Minister for F for Foreign Affairs", "start": 1122.72, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "of Indonesia.", "start": 1124.72, "duration": 3.24}]